Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_Woman3::
	.string "In the past, POKéMON used to light\n"
	.string "the sea around OLIVINE at night.\p"
	.string "The LIGHTHOUSE was made in honor of\n"
	.string "those POKéMON.$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_Sailor::
	.string "People train at this LIGHTHOUSE.\p"
	.string "It’s not easy to climb because of\n"
	.string "all the trainers.$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_Sailor261Intro::
	.string "Men of the sea are always spoiling\n"
	.string "for a good fight!$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_Sailor261Defeat::
	.string "Urf!\n"
	.string "I lose!$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_Sailor261::
	.string "What power!\n"
	.string "How would you like to sail the\l"
	.string "seas with me?$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_GentlemanAlfredIntro::
	.string "Hm? This is no place for playing$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_GentlemanAlfredDefeat::
	.string "Ah! I can see that you’re serious.$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_GentlemanAlfred::
	.string "Up top is a POKéMON that keeps the\n"
	.string "LIGHTHOUSE lit.\p"
	.string "But I hear that it’s sick now and\n"
	.string "can’t be cured by ordinary medicine.$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_BirdKeeperTheoIntro::
	.string "Why are you here?\n"
	.string "Are you just going to gawk?\l"
	.string "I suggest that you leave!$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_BirdKeeperTheoDefeat::
	.string "You really are concerned...$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_BirdKeeperTheo::
	.string "How the heck do you go up?\p"
	.string "I want to visit the sick POKéMON,\n"
	.string "but I can’t get up there...$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_GentlemanPrestonIntro::
	.string "I travel the world to train my\n"
	.string "POKéMON. I wish to battle with you.$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_GentlemanPrestonDefeat::
	.string "…sigh… I must train some more…$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_GentlemanPreston::
	.string "JASMINE used to use rock POKéMON\n"
	.string "like ONIX.$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_LassConnieIntro::
	.string "JASMINE is this city’s GYM LEADER.\p"
	.string "I mean to bring her back with me.\n"
	.string "Nobody had better get in my way!$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_LassConnieDefeat::
	.string "Aaack! My POKéMON!$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_LassConnie::
	.string "Right. Anybody would be worried\n"
	.string "if his or her own POKéMON were hurt.\p"
	.string "I’ll pray for the POKéMON here, so\n"
	.string "JASMINE can come back to the GYM.$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_SailorKentIntro::
	.string "JASMINE must be worried sick about\n"
	.string "the POKéMON here.\p"
	.string "She won’t even smile these days.$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_SailorKentDefeat::
	.string "I can’t manage a smile either...$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_SailorKent::
	.string "Speaking of sick, I’ve heard there’s\n"
	.string "a good PHARMACY in CIANWOOD.$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_BirdKeeperDenisIntro::
	.string "We’re pretty high up here. My bird\n"
	.string "POKéMON are in prime form.$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_BirdKeeperDenisDefeat::
	.string "Oops... They crashed...$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_BirdKeeperDenis::
	.string "My POKéMON learned how to use FLY in\n"
	.string "CIANWOOD.\p"
	.string "Well, since I’m a loser, I’ll FLY\n"
	.string "across the sea...$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_SailorTerrellIntro::
	.string "Sailors are both kind and strong.\n"
	.string "How about you?$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_SailorTerrellDefeat::
	.string "You are both kind and strong...$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_SailorTerrell::
	.string "Every time I come back to OLIVINE, I\n"
	.string "visit the GYM.\p"
	.string "The GYM LEADER’s POKéMON type has\n"
	.string "changed without me noticing.$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_SailorErnestIntro::
	.string "I wanted to battle JASMINE, but she’s\n"
	.string "not up to it now.\l"
	.string "So, how about you?$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_SailorErnestDefeat::
	.string "Whoa, whoa. You’re overwhelming!$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_SailorErnest::
	.string "A GYM LEADER isn’t about just being\n"
	.string "strong. A LEADER also needs to be\l"
	.string "compassionate.$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_Lass_1::
	.string "JASMINE: ...This POKéMON always\n"
	.string "kept the sea lit at night.\p"
	.string "But it suddenly got sick... It’s\n"
	.string "gasping for air...\p"
	.string "...I understand that there is a\n"
	.string "wonderful PHARMACY in CIANWOOD...\p"
	.string "But that’s across the sea...\n"
	.string "And I can’t leave AMPHY unattended...\p"
	.string "...May I ask you to get some medicine\n"
	.string "for me? Please?$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_Lass_2::
	.string "JASMINE: ...Will that medicine cure\n"
	.string "AMPHY?$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_Lass_3::
	.string "JASMINE: ...I see...$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_Lass_4::
	.string "...AMPHY, hang on!$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_Lass_5::
	.string "...May I ask you to get some medicine\n"
	.string "for me? Please?$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_Lass_6::
	.string "{PLAYER} handed the SECRETPOTION to\n"
	.string "JASMINE\p"
	.string "JASMINE: ...Um, please don’t be\n"
	.string "offended...\p"
	.string "...AMPHY will not take anything from\n"
	.string "anyone but me...$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_Lass_7::
	.string "JASMINE: ...\p"
	.string "AMPHY, how are you feeling?$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_Lass_8::
	.string "AMPHY: Palu!\n"
	.string "Palulu!$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_Lass_9::
	.string "JASMINE: ...Oh, I’m so relieved...\p"
	.string "This is just so wonderful...\p"
	.string "Thank you so very, very much.\p"
	.string "...I will return to the GYM...$"

Lighthouse_Interior2_Text_Nidorino::
	.string "AMPHY: ...\n"
	.string "...Pa... paloo...\p"
	.string "Its breathing is terribly labored...$"
